w:rustUnboundedMapProof a p:Task ; rdfs:label "Prove ledger transfer equivalence for arbitrary maps and keys" ;
    p:milestone w:rustImportMilestone ; p:status p:blocked ; p:source w:roundTripPlan ;
    p:dependsOn w:rustRecovery ; p:evidence w:rustValidationEvidence ;
    p:reason "The verifier harness fixes keys and map size. Neither an arbitrary key-renaming lemma nor a bystander-extension lemma has been discharged." ;
    p:acceptance "Discharge lookup invariance under key renaming and map extension with arbitrary unrelated accounts for both production bodies, and establish safety and reachability in that execution model." .

